sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant ENG as Rule Engine
  participant BANK as Bank email or chat
  actor CO as Compliance officer
  participant CK as Cockpit
  ENG->>BANK: publish-requested event (host routes it)
  BANK-->>CO: card-fee v3 waits for approval
  CO->>CK: Approvals, open card-fee v3
  CK->>ENG: GET diff v2 to v3
  ENG-->>CK: R3 fee 30000 VND to 35000 VND, nothing else
  CO->>CK: Simulation with 3 own edge cases
  CK->>ENG: simulate v3 (needs rules:simulate, nothing logged)
  ENG-->>CK: results next to v2
  alt understood and correct
    CO->>CK: Approve, comment "Pricing committee 10 Dec, item 14"
    CK->>ENG: approve (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    ENG-->>CK: PUBLISHED, published event
  else wrong or unclear
    CO->>CK: Reject, comment required
    CK->>ENG: reject
    ENG-->>CK: DRAFT, rejected event to the author
  end
  alt the approver is the requester
    ENG-->>CK: Approve disabled, API refuses with 403 SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN
  else a second approver acted first
    ENG-->>CK: 409 or 412, reload shows the new status
  end
